{"4219590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tractor Racers", "steam_appid": 4219590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tractor Racers</strong> is a single-player racing and challenge-based game where players take control of powerful tractors and compete across <strong>12 unique challenges</strong>, each designed to test driving skill, balance, speed, and strategy. Players can choose from a wide range of <strong>tractors with different performance characteristics</strong> and attach various <strong>trolleys</strong> that influence weight, stability, and gameplay difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in diverse rural and off-road environments, the game features exciting  challenges. With progressive difficulty and meaningful vehicle choices, <i>Tractor Racers</i> delivers an engaging and skill-focused tractor racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple playable tractors with different performance stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Variety of trolleys affecting weight, balance, and handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 unique skill-based challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with realistic tractor handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different variety of tractors, trolleys, and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance-based scoring and rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Win the Race, Rule the Land&quot;</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tractor Racers</strong> is a single-player racing and challenge-based game where players take control of powerful tractors and compete across <strong>12 unique challenges</strong>, each designed to test driving skill, balance, speed, and str